@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### =========================================================
### STEP 1 — Start Salesforce login (no password needed, gets you a URL)
### =========================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/social-login?authProvider=salesforce&environment=sandbox


### =========================================================
### STEP 2 — Callback (paste fresh code + state here after authorizing
### the URL from Step 1 in your browser, then Send immediately)
### =========================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/social-login/callback?authProvider=salesforce&code=aPrxJCWttG81hkKJZJ0wDLEkmwso8.kfDpGvbs8OPIoCTwS2pE3FU1Sbmxyg34kne2tg8m5CBRXjD2QXTLXSIvDh3gmnDV4%3D&state=89c5321d6f9fc58a8307d4040ec5fd31
//GET http://localhost:5173/login-callback/salesforce?code=&state=5ffc87f594ee5c78c9e3349bda04e252

### =========================================================
### STEP 3 — Verify you're logged in + connected
### =========================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/my-profile

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/list


### =========================================================
### DATA ENDPOINTS (use only after Step 3 shows a connected CRM)
### =========================================================

### Backup configs
GET {{baseUrl}}/backup-config/list

### Backup jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/backup-job/list

### Archival configs
GET {{baseUrl}}/archival-config/list

### Restore configs
GET {{baseUrl}}/restore/config/list

### Destinations
GET {{baseUrl}}/destination/list

### Dashboard overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/overview

### Storage overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/storage/overview

### Settings (standard objects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings

### CRM metadata — all Salesforce objects
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm-metadata/all-objects/list


### =========================================================
### LOGOUT
### =========================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
